favicon.svg and favicon.png are based on "File:日本文様-千鳥模様.svg" (a chidori,
a plover, a traditional Japanese pattern) by Pneuma01, from Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E6%A7%98-%E5%8D%83%E9%B3%A5%E6%A8%A1%E6%A7%98.svg

They are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
license (CC BY 4.0), not under the license of ebira:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes from the original: the editor's metadata is removed, the picture is
centered on a square with a white background with rounded corners, and
favicon.png is favicon.svg rendered at 64 pixels.
